@baseUrl = http://localhost:4002
@token = replace-with-a-bearer-token
@userId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@roleId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Public user profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Accept: application/json

### Self-service profile update (the mobile profile camera sends the completed MediaScope.User URL)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "CompanyHQ",
  "lastName": "Member",
  "bio": "Operations lead at head office.",
  "profileImageUrl": "https://media.example.test/user/profile.jpg"
}

### 400: profile image must be HTTPS
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "CompanyHQ",
  "lastName": "Member",
  "profileImageUrl": "http://example.test/profile.jpg"
}

### 401: self-service update requires authentication
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Unauthenticated",
  "lastName": "Caller"
}

### 403: user search needs an admin (anonymous and non-admin alike)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users?search=member
Accept: application/json

### Lookup matches an exact email, not a fragment
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/lookup?search=member@companyhq.test
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Lookup by a domain fragment finds nothing
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/lookup?search=companyhq.test
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### List my favorite places
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/favorite-places
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Toggle a favorite place on or off (kind is the place search's OpenStreetMap amenity value)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/favorite-places
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": -26.1076,
  "longitude": 28.0567,
  "name": "Parkview Pharmacy",
  "kind": "pharmacy",
  "address": "11 First Avenue, Parkview",
  "phone": "+27110000000"
}

### Create a reusable staff role with Client permissions
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/access-roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Sales Staff"}

### Grant selected content and template permissions to the saved role
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/access-roles/{{roleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Sales Staff","permissions":["search_area","get_my_notification_preferences","list_blog_posts","get_blog_post","create_blog_post"]}

### Assign the same named role when editing an account
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"roleName":"Sales Staff"}

### 403: caller without roles.manage cannot edit shared roles
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/access-roles
Authorization: Bearer replace-with-a-client-token
